nxopen-journal-toolkit bundles two MIT-licensed works.

1. nxopen-journal
   Source : https://github.com/EVOL233awa/nxopen-journal
   License: MIT (LICENSES/nxopen-journal-MIT.txt)
   Usage  : read-only snapshot under src/nxopen_journal_toolkit/_skill/

2. nxopen-mcp-enhanced
   Upstream: https://github.com/mingfeng6684/nxopen-mcp (MIT)
   Fork    : namespaced as nxopen-mcp-enhanced, distributed as a dependency
   License: MIT (LICENSES/nxopen-mcp-MIT.txt)

The bundled skill snapshot is generated by tools/sync_skill.py; its source
commit and per-file SHA-256 hashes are recorded in
src/nxopen_journal_toolkit/_skill/vendor-manifest.json.
